    },
    "title": "893f141b855c",
    "description": "14dd4f5ad276",
    "tags": "5c6f9c6121a6",
    "thumbnail": "55990f902a53"
  },
  "lines": {
    "p001": {
      "source_hash": "d871741cf4e8",
      "text": "Chief! My drawing,"
    },
    "p002": {
      "source_hash": "7c46f3a4e5c8",
      "text": "and one swipe smudged it all!"
    },
    "p003": {
      "source_hash": "e0596744ef7e",
      "text": "My hand's all black too!"
    },
    "p004": {
      "source_hash": "1998171d0414",
      "text": "That black stuff on your hand"
    },
    "p005": {
      "source_hash": "c068330d224c",
      "text": "mostly rubbed off your pencil lead."
    },
    "p006": {
      "source_hash": "6bb37e27f1b5",
      "text": "Why does lead rub off so easily?"
    },
    "p007": {
      "source_hash": "0d6f73b58d2d",
      "text": "We'll find out soon. Here's something weird: this black stuff"
    },
    "p008": {
      "source_hash": "8c3fbf2f5583",
      "text": "and a shiny diamond are both made of carbon."
    },
    "p009": {
      "source_hash": "896ce03b5af3",
      "text": "No way! Diamonds are hard!"
    },
    "p011": {
      "source_hash": "d2734acfc242",
      "text": "It's true. And weirder still: even the hardest diamond has something it fears."
    },
    "p012": {
      "source_hash": "f1fd31992317",
      "text": "And the line your pencil draws can do something a diamond can't."
    },
    "p013": {
      "source_hash": "d8648b36d101",
      "text": "Just one thing is different,"
    },
    "p014": {
      "source_hash": "5e2623cb0a89",
      "text": "and it's hiding in your everyday pencil."
    },
    "p015": {
      "source_hash": "f27f0c18981c",
      "text": "Both carbon,"
    },
    "p016": {
      "source_hash": "a8923e670d51",
      "text": "so why so different?"
    },
    "p017": {
      "source_hash": "efa7f8dcd3a0",
      "text": "So what's different? Look in your pencil."
    },
    "p018": {
      "source_hash": "a642f8849a1c",
      "text": "Take the lead apart: it's really two things mixed."
    },
    "p019": {
      "source_hash": "552579ef4cf2",
      "text": "Which two?"
    },
    "p020": {
      "source_hash": "2a04b7f04ba4",
      "text": "One is shiny black graphite,"
    },
    "p021": {
      "source_hash": "fcf094559c1d",
      "text": "the other is clay, the kind you make pots with."
    },
    "p022": {
      "source_hash": "321d3078839c",
      "text": "Dirt can write?"
    },
    "p023": {
      "source_hash": "5f8d5c239b32",
      "text": "Clay can't write. It glues the graphite into a stick,"
    },
    "p024": {
      "source_hash": "8794dea77ea9",
      "text": "so it's shaped and sturdier."
    },
    "p025": {
      "source_hash": "5f04f4b61634",
      "text": "Ever notice some pencils draw extra dark and soft?"
    },
    "p027": {
      "source_hash": "300e52214e22",
      "text": "Why's it darker?"
    },
    "p028": {
      "source_hash": "0934e09effd1",
      "text": "It has more graphite."
    },
    "p029": {
      "source_hash": "ff2390d54fad",
      "text": "More clay: harder lead, lighter lines."
    },
    "p030": {
      "source_hash": "af22f528f621",
      "text": "Mine must have tons of graphite!"
    },
    "p031": {
      "source_hash": "07fa7e89b358",
      "text": "The black is graphite?"
    },
    "p032": {
      "source_hash": "83e6a6e28a66",
      "text": "Yes. That layer on your hand is mostly graphite."
    },
    "p033": {
      "source_hash": "9962aab09237",
      "text": "It feels slippery!"
    },
    "p034": {
      "source_hash": "68a35e5d5098",
      "text": "Right, graphite feels a bit slippery, with a metal shine."
    },
    "p035": {
      "source_hash": "35654ee49af7",
      "text": "And diamond?"
    },
    "p036": {
      "source_hash": "8a135a8b073c",
      "text": "Must be something else!"
    },
    "p037": {
      "source_hash": "0daba76b3a6b",
      "text": "My mom's ring"
    },
    "p038": {
      "source_hash": "37727015196a",
      "text": "has one!"
    },
    "p039": {
      "source_hash": "9af3143e9878",
      "text": "Your mom's is the same,"
    },
    "p040": {
      "source_hash": "51eb3e1e0cc3",
      "text": "almost all carbon, like I said."
    },
    "p041": {
      "source_hash": "8b1b6aada0f7",
      "text": "A fancier kind of carbon?"
    },
    "p042": {
      "source_hash": "783e05066528",
      "text": "Carbon's carbon. In graphite or in diamond,"
    },
    "p043": {
      "source_hash": "424e87fe4b97",
      "text": "compare them one by one: exactly the same."
    },
    "p044": {
      "source_hash": "f8966bfe22cd",
      "text": "Then what's different?"
    },
    "p045": {
      "source_hash": "b0c4b9107949",
      "text": "My guess: how the carbon is arranged."
    },
    "p047": {
      "source_hash": "5ee41b1b913f",
      "text": "changes so much?"
    },
    "p048": {
      "source_hash": "adefedbbbacd",
      "text": "Yes. Let's build both with a box of building blocks."
    },
    "p049": {
      "source_hash": "363e5d47fa82",
      "text": "Balls are carbon,"
    },
    "p050": {
      "source_hash": "0c8e6da1b695",
      "text": "and sticks are the hands they hold."
    },
    "p051": {
      "source_hash": "58ccb674388b",
      "text": "Like mine!"
    },
    "p053": {
      "source_hash": "a633ade8f262",
      "text": "I bet diamond's"
    },
    "p054": {
      "source_hash": "80ec10b80812",
      "text": "carbon's packed tighter!"
    },
    "p055": {
      "source_hash": "6c442ceabc5d",
      "text": "Hold that. We'll check it."
    },
    "p056": {
      "source_hash": "c30cae1980c7",
      "text": "But the biggest difference is how many hands each carbon holds."
    },
    "p057": {
      "source_hash": "d8964f9fda77",
      "text": "Each carbon has up to four hands."
    },
    "p058": {
      "source_hash": "4746fc520d07",
      "text": "In graphite, each ball holds three others,"
    },
    "p059": {
      "source_hash": "66c1e7d1041e",
      "text": "all flat on one level, making a flat net."
    },
    "p061": {
      "source_hash": "33fdaeae1442",
      "text": "Isn't one hand empty?"
    },
    "p062": {
      "source_hash": "2ac2326eb5dd",
      "text": "Good counting! That empty hand matters a lot."
    },
    "p063": {
      "source_hash": "6e2050b98d4e",
      "text": "More on it later."
    },
    "p064": {
      "source_hash": "8febf20b35b8",
      "text": "One net is strong, but graphite is lots of nets"
    },
    "p065": {
      "source_hash": "4d5d6b39365d",
      "text": "stacked layer on layer."
    },
    "p067": {
      "source_hash": "87b447e1feb2",
      "text": "Is there glue?"
    },
    "p068": {
      "source_hash": "75e5bfca9ce1",
      "text": "No sticks between layers, just a very weak pull."
    },
    "p069": {
      "source_hash": "56a5bb3d07ce",
      "text": "And farther apart,"
    },
    "p070": {
      "source_hash": "1d51ec8161d2",
      "text": "over twice the gap between balls in one net."
    },
    "p072": {
      "source_hash": "4f01b2a87e0b",
      "text": "what happens?"
    },
    "p073": {
      "source_hash": "b3788daa8067",
      "text": "Remember it. A push will show."
    },
    "p074": {
      "source_hash": "9744188a79e0",
      "text": "Strong nets,"
    },
    "p075": {
      "source_hash": "6b10689f9bd7",
      "text": "so how's the stack soft?"
    },
    "p076": {
      "source_hash": "9c16b98ff962",
      "text": "Not inside the nets—"
    },
    "p077": {
      "source_hash": "11e834d58c6d",
      "text": "it's between layers. But diamond is different."
    },
    "p078": {
      "source_hash": "b97202fb5e26",
      "text": "Same blocks, but every ball holds all four hands,"
    },
    "p079": {
      "source_hash": "d2bc09142bd3",
      "text": "reaching four different ways."
    },
    "p080": {
      "source_hash": "81256f424565",
      "text": "All used up?"
    },
    "p081": {
      "source_hash": "1976f63c77df",
      "text": "Yes, no empty hands. Remember!"
    },
    "p082": {
      "source_hash": "72c4903a557c",
      "text": "It all joins into one big jungle gym."
    },
    "p083": {
      "source_hash": "e24199e5e384",
      "text": "Like the park!"
    },
    "p085": {
      "source_hash": "4c648f901c3e",
      "text": "Graphite: nets,"
    },
    "p086": {
      "source_hash": "73156ca3a8c8",
      "text": "diamond: jungle gym, right?"
    },
    "p087": {
      "source_hash": "62633d118ee1",
      "text": "First: this is just a model."
    },
    "p088": {
      "source_hash": "6415a0a38f10",
      "text": "Carbon isn't wooden balls; hands aren't sticks."
    },
    "p089": {
      "source_hash": "40bfefb45dff",
      "text": "The sticks just show who's joined to who,"
    },
    "p090": {
      "source_hash": "9f77bfaa5e17",
      "text": "and how tightly."
    },
    "p091": {
      "source_hash": "e96c4cd803a5",
      "text": "But is it right?"
    },
    "p092": {
      "source_hash": "3797269697cc",
      "text": "What I like is you can use it to guess,"
    },
    "p093": {
      "source_hash": "889a021dbc97",
      "text": "then we test it."
    },
    "p094": {
      "source_hash": "9c9573b6aad6",
      "text": "So can it guess"
    },
    "p095": {
      "source_hash": "8f7bce58fb93",
      "text": "which is harder?"
    },
    "p096": {
      "source_hash": "6095ca4c54bf",
      "text": "Yes. Let's push graphite's stack of nets."
    },
    "p097": {
      "source_hash": "2edb3931085a",
      "text": "Layers far apart, held only lightly, right?"
    },
    "p098": {
      "source_hash": "0b3d7344bc08",
      "text": "So one light push slides the top layers right off."
    },
    "p099": {
      "source_hash": "ab5613722b0b",
      "text": "It slid off!"
    },
    "p100": {
      "source_hash": "9269d1292691",
      "text": "Yes, that's writing. Paper is rough; rub the lead,"
    },
    "p101": {
      "source_hash": "5b1c2285ff32",
      "text": "outer layers slide off and leave a black line."
    },
    "p102": {
      "source_hash": "8f0c346b9cd9",
      "text": "And my hand too?"
    },
    "p103": {
      "source_hash": "66e5e31cddda",
      "text": "Yes, like you asked. One rub,"
    },
    "p104": {
      "source_hash": "c695cb0dedf2",
      "text": "thin graphite slides onto your hand and it smudges."
    },
    "p105": {
      "source_hash": "92baac51872e",
      "text": "Another guess: stacked nets have big gaps,"
    },
    "p106": {
      "source_hash": "be71d9a47047",
      "text": "so same size, graphite should be lighter."
    },
    "p107": {
      "source_hash": "436b9ca29f70",
      "text": "Is it really lighter?"
    },
    "p108": {
      "source_hash": "a07443c04458",
      "text": "Remember your guess: diamond's packed tighter?"
    },
    "p109": {
      "source_hash": "b93410f8aa19",
      "text": "Same size, diamond is more than 50% heavier."
    },
    "p110": {
      "source_hash": "23cd33a1058b",
      "text": "I guessed right!"
    },
    "p111": {
      "source_hash": "91c439343758",
      "text": "Yes, a jungle gym has no big gaps between layers."
    },
    "p113": {
      "source_hash": "821e550b2d91",
      "text": "Can't push it!"
    },
    "p114": {
      "source_hash": "f8567856c72a",
      "text": "Push: each ball is held all round,"
    },
    "p115": {
      "source_hash": "fd4401b287c2",
      "text": "no layer slides."
    },
    "p116": {
      "source_hash": "d71130df1d6e",
      "text": "To scratch it, many strong hands"
    },
    "p117": {
      "source_hash": "4990fc848e7a",
      "text": "must all snap."
    },
    "p118": {
      "source_hash": "5560f1e54ca6",
      "text": "Graphite doesn't snap?"
    },
    "p119": {
      "source_hash": "2c75b8bf6c09",
      "text": "Right, just slide one layer. Not one hand in the net breaks."
    },
    "p120": {
      "source_hash": "c99e3ab861b6",
      "text": "Diamonds are hard to scratch?"
    },
    "p121": {
      "source_hash": "6b2bb66e5d6d",
      "text": "Yes. In science, hard means hard to scratch."
    },
    "p122": {
      "source_hash": "4e6f33efe4af",
      "text": "One hardness scale: the scratcher is harder,"
    },
    "p123": {
      "source_hash": "ea903cb15fbe",
      "text": "from softest, one, to hardest, ten."
    },
    "p124": {
      "source_hash": "17f25ea4e22f",
      "text": "Graphite: just one or two; nails scratch it;"
    },
    "p125": {
      "source_hash": "21657eaab096",
      "text": "diamond is the top: ten."
    },
    "p126": {
      "source_hash": "5b170eb727f6",
      "text": "Only diamond scratches diamond."
    },
    "p127": {
      "source_hash": "2af31c0656e0",
      "text": "Hardest means"
    },
    "p128": {
      "source_hash": "9e915f6d6ee5",
      "text": "it can't break!"
    },
    "p129": {
      "source_hash": "0d83f3d9696c",
      "text": "Lots of people guess that. But hard and hard to break aren't the same."
    },
    "p130": {
      "source_hash": "de3bad058e6e",
      "text": "What's different?"
    },
    "p131": {
      "source_hash": "0212622f4f5b",
      "text": "Hard is what we said: hard to scratch;"
    },
    "p132": {
      "source_hash": "9a747dee4d82",
      "text": "tough means not cracking when hit hard."
    },
    "p133": {
      "source_hash": "4e65fd9ae722",
      "text": "Think of glass: nails can't scratch it,"
    },
    "p134": {
      "source_hash": "2a00858f1da2",
      "text": "but drop it and it can shatter."
    },
    "p135": {
      "source_hash": "74e5e051db5d",
      "text": "I broke one once…"
    },
    "p136": {
      "source_hash": "850745bee5c1",
      "text": "You know!"
    },
    "p137": {
      "source_hash": "afd3bdbe47b8",
      "text": "Remember? Even the hardest diamond fears something."
    },
    "p138": {
      "source_hash": "1409fd3e1de0",
      "text": "What does it fear?"
    },
    "p139": {
      "source_hash": "60c418ab5e0c",
      "text": "One hard hit."
    },
    "p140": {
      "source_hash": "875b76f4cfd4",
      "text": "However hard, a heavy knock"
    },
    "p141": {
      "source_hash": "761dfec2eafe",
      "text": "can still crack a diamond or chip a corner."
    },
    "p142": {
      "source_hash": "3500e6811c3a",
      "text": "Jungle gyms crack too?"
    },
    "p143": {
      "source_hash": "a85b9ba19d2b",
      "text": "Yes. Some directions have fewer hands across,"
    },
    "p144": {
      "source_hash": "4c85d116fc0f",
      "text": "and along those, it cracks easier."
    },
    "p145": {
      "source_hash": "d581f606639f",
      "text": "Diamond cutters sometimes split it on purpose along those."
    },
    "p146": {
      "source_hash": "c5e72d87938a",
      "text": "On purpose?"
    },
    "p147": {
      "source_hash": "45a05257f946",
      "text": "Yes, they use its weakest directions."
    },
    "p149": {
      "source_hash": "452f79174def",
      "text": "can it guess more?"
    },
    "p150": {
      "source_hash": "c5df59e6a6fd",
      "text": "Yes. Remember your pencil line can do something"
    },
    "p151": {
      "source_hash": "575d4be8944d",
      "text": "diamond can't?"
    },
    "p152": {
      "source_hash": "1f251cefee91",
      "text": "What is it?"
    },
    "p153": {
      "source_hash": "eaf84f36abed",
      "text": "Let electricity flow. With a soft pencil, press and draw"
    },
    "p154": {
      "source_hash": "c74b38c7922f",
      "text": "a thick, dark, unbroken line; hook its ends to a battery and a bulb."
    },
    "p156": {
      "source_hash": "6fef8975b140",
      "text": "and pencils aren't metal!"
    },
    "p157": {
      "source_hash": "9df17569fa63",
      "text": "But many people have tried this,"
    },
    "p158": {
      "source_hash": "9cec535753f8",
      "text": "and the tiny bulb really lights!"
    },
    "p160": {
      "source_hash": "6369b37777b6",
      "text": "Why does graphite work?"
    },
    "p161": {
      "source_hash": "792ab6fac725",
      "text": "Remember the empty hand in the net?"
    },
    "p162": {
      "source_hash": "043ced547b65",
      "text": "Current is lots of tiny charged bits running along,"
    },
    "p163": {
      "source_hash": "0cb601ba721e",
      "text": "called electrons."
    },
    "p164": {
      "source_hash": "657a837884fd",
      "text": "Where do they run?"
    },
    "p165": {
      "source_hash": "408e65571cbe",
      "text": "Each carbon's empty hand lets one electron run"
    },
    "p166": {
      "source_hash": "ccabff228a30",
      "text": "all around the whole net."
    },
    "p167": {
      "source_hash": "41ec31f7e656",
      "text": "Your pencil line is their road,"
    },
    "p168": {
      "source_hash": "536207648b27",
      "text": "through the bulb, so it lights up."
    },
    "p169": {
      "source_hash": "35654ee49af7",
      "text": "And diamond?"
    },
    "p171": {
      "source_hash": "54490725d112",
      "text": "I bet it won't light!"
    },
    "p172": {
      "source_hash": "82889c7e93bf",
      "text": "Right. All hands are full, so electrons can't run."
    },
    "p173": {
      "source_hash": "ee0c162b9242",
      "text": "So most diamonds hardly carry electricity. No light."
    },
    "p174": {
      "source_hash": "ff3433bf7ad5",
      "text": "Truth is, a rare blue diamond"
    },
    "p175": {
      "source_hash": "fedb191448f3",
      "text": "has something mixed in; it carries a bit."
    },
    "p176": {
      "source_hash": "5312ed72cf78",
      "text": "Blue ones?"
    },
    "p177": {
      "source_hash": "04f0adbd6df0",
      "text": "Yes, but very rare. That's why I said most diamonds."
    },
    "p178": {
      "source_hash": "4a6e961a6bd0",
      "text": "Going another way,"
    },
    "p179": {
      "source_hash": "59461bd449cc",
      "text": "does it flow as well?"
    },
    "p180": {
      "source_hash": "3ae923f7101a",
      "text": "In a net, easy;"
    },
    "p181": {
      "source_hash": "fecefdacb696",
      "text": "jumping to the next layer is much harder."
    },
    "p182": {
      "source_hash": "2de9b1740126",
      "text": "Measured: along layers is hundreds to a thousand times easier than across."
    },
    "p183": {
      "source_hash": "640fcab67e90",
      "text": "That much!"
    },
    "p184": {
      "source_hash": "e431476226f0",
      "text": "I want to try!"
    },
    "p185": {
      "source_hash": "97569b53079b",
      "text": "Use only small batteries for this,"
    },
    "p186": {
      "source_hash": "157a151d5216",
      "text": "and never, ever play with wall sockets."
    },
    "p187": {
      "source_hash": "684fb2d8222c",
      "text": "If they say carbon conducts,"
    },
    "p188": {
      "source_hash": "37a4d64beb54",
      "text": "ask: carbon arranged which way?"
    },
    "p189": {
      "source_hash": "2ee2278f1874",
      "text": "Just carbon"
    },
    "p190": {
      "source_hash": "81f447cc243c",
      "text": "isn't enough?"
    },
    "p191": {
      "source_hash": "b65975dbbebb",
      "text": "You tell me, Little Q."
    },
    "p192": {
      "source_hash": "dbca91e664e3",
      "text": "Aha!"
    },
    "p193": {
      "source_hash": "81da124d08d4",
      "text": "My lead and Mom's diamond:"
    },
    "p194": {
      "source_hash": "bda0a132af97",
      "text": "same carbon, different order!"
    },
    "p195": {
      "source_hash": "2c21d6ec7a14",
      "text": "Nice! You linked pencil and diamond."
    },
    "p196": {
      "source_hash": "b301719f8164",
      "text": "That's what I love most about materials."
    },
    "p197": {
      "source_hash": "2d5db14c7ae8",
      "text": "Will my drawings still smudge?"
    },
    "p198": {
      "source_hash": "c22eb4255216",
      "text": "Yes. But try a small test first."
    },
    "p199": {
      "source_hash": "b5965e093cab",
      "text": "Next time, take a darker pencil and a lighter one,"
    },
    "p200": {
      "source_hash": "66286bb9fafd",
      "text": "shade a bit each,"
    },
    "p201": {
      "source_hash": "5e95e3d9877f",
      "text": "then rub them?"
    },
    "p202": {
      "source_hash": "c3c924160cc5",
      "text": "Yes, see which one smudges more."
    },
    "p203": {
      "source_hash": "da47e3ba0ed0",
      "text": "The dark!"
    },
    "p205": {
      "source_hash": "a9bb0c4594b1",
      "text": "Good thinking. Remember? The light one has more clay."
    },
    "p206": {
      "source_hash": "36d742bcb996",
      "text": "So that's why!"
    },
    "p207": {
      "source_hash": "ad21646310f3",
      "text": "Which pencil smears most?"
    },
    "p208": {
      "source_hash": "fe508e80b52e",
      "text": "Tell us below."
    },
    "p209": {
      "source_hash": "88de677d4daa",
      "text": "Find life's everyday whys with us. Subscribe to So That's Why."
    }
  }
}
